                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most approbative"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a70e2eef-cfe7-3057-a44b-c49afedf358a",
                        "entry_id": "abb1e4e4-79eb-3860-8dda-1266f900d238",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Expressing approval."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "419e9f94-9b81-46a5-a3ad-aadc93b17304",
                                "sense_id": "a70e2eef-cfe7-3057-a44b-c49afedf358a",
                                "text": "approbative criticism"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32497e38-1ddb-4606-951b-3a9d927490f4",
                                "sense_id": "a70e2eef-cfe7-3057-a44b-c49afedf358a",
                                "text": "His late Display of unparralled [sic] Generosity to a distressed, though reputable Family, will be enrolled in the Court above; and from the recording Angel, instead of a Tear, extort an approbative smile."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a602bc54-bdc4-45ab-aa3c-fc3c603e91d7",
                                "sense_id": "a70e2eef-cfe7-3057-a44b-c49afedf358a",
                                "text": "[…] the approbative shouts of his half-intoxicated auditors filled his simple soul with delight and pride."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0db6e603-a7c4-43ef-821f-e72d9be64401",
                                "sense_id": "a70e2eef-cfe7-3057-a44b-c49afedf358a",
                                "text": "An Irish friend then in his nineties once asked me if there were any Yiddish words that weren’t critical. I told him there must be some, though I did not know them. Even words that might seem approbative like chachem for wise man, with the slightest turn take on an ironic twist."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4d49ca6b-76fc-37b7-a929-78e0825eb228",
                        "entry_id": "abb1e4e4-79eb-3860-8dda-1266f900d238",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Sanctioning officially, giving authorization or approval to something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6556f345-5089-4ace-a772-cec8a18a336e",
                                "sense_id": "4d49ca6b-76fc-37b7-a929-78e0825eb228",
                                "text": "And if the words have any graine of truth in them, they must be undestood [sic] not of an Authorative, but onely of a Consultive Power to advise him, or at the most approbative, to give their assent to Laws propounded, he having limited himselfe to make no Laws without them."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "874a676d-6313-468a-8249-1ed9739b6b38",
                        "source_entry_id": "abb1e4e4-79eb-3860-8dda-1266f900d238",
                        "source_sense_description": "expressing approval — see also approving",
                        "target_lang_word": "approbateur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "approbateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "30c9cd32-53b1-3cc7-84c9-6bafe714a6fa",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba4daea-1cae-33f6-a37f-c2774b725466",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui approuve par un témoignage d’estime."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06bf9ad9-857f-4de3-b938-b801190177c5",
                                                "sense_id": "30c9cd32-53b1-3cc7-84c9-6bafe714a6fa",
                                                "text": "Une pareille conduite n’aura guère d’approbateurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4070724-d943-3a0a-afc7-8e5b60f51e86",
                                        "entry_id": "5ba4daea-1cae-33f6-a37f-c2774b725466",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Censeur qui avait donné son approbation publique à un livre, à un ouvrage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22358765-5c41-4c0a-bbc5-0e3edd107b5a",
                                                "sense_id": "d4070724-d943-3a0a-afc7-8e5b60f51e86",
                                                "text": "Les approbateurs de son livre furent tels et tels docteurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "approbateur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce2038d0-5001-308e-a66f-01ff80372aab",
                                        "entry_id": "ad1de258-5752-3bbd-bf3d-ac584c2de24a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui approuve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "683e433d-ad6a-40d7-a146-cd9f59e9ce2f",
                                                "sense_id": "ce2038d0-5001-308e-a66f-01ff80372aab",
                                                "text": "Sa mère n’était pas toujours approbatrice, mais Bubu, dont les convictions étaient fortes, trouva des paroles solides qui la remirent en place et même lui montra deux ou trois fois qu’il était un homme d’action et n’aimait pas les contradicteurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79264378-2b4b-481c-9707-835b17ecd5ad",
                                                "sense_id": "ce2038d0-5001-308e-a66f-01ff80372aab",
                                                "text": "Mais ce jour-là elle avait croisé des regards approbateurs, elle avait entendu des silences d’estomaquement – si, si – et elle savait, aussi fillasse et peu sûre d'elle qu'elle était, qu'elle avait fait le job."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa2d2ebb-1982-48fa-bc54-dc65bde4fc1f",
                                                "sense_id": "ce2038d0-5001-308e-a66f-01ff80372aab",
                                                "text": "Dès leur arrivée à Monroe, ces derniers furent brutalement attaqués, sous les regards approbateurs de la police locale, par des suprémacistes blancs aux cris de « Tuez les nègres ! » — (Caroline Rolland-Diamond, Black America: Une histoire des luttes pour l'égalité et la justice (XIXᵉ-XXIᵉ siècle), Éditions La Découverte, 2016)"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
